{"id":"a62d3691c564e069","group":"14","path":"14/14-thm-heyting-negation-laws.md","title":"Theorem — Two Laws of Heyting Negation","display":"Theorem — Two Laws of Heyting Negation","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-thm-heyting-negation-laws","aliases":["14-thm-heyting-negation-laws"],"display":"Theorem — Two Laws of Heyting Negation","depends_on":["[[14-df-category]]","[[14-df-subobjects]]","[[14-thm-subobject-heyting-algebra]]","[[14-df-heyting-negation]]","[[14-df-elementary-topos]]"],"source_status":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-thm-heyting-negation-laws"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-thm-heyting-negation-laws</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Theorem — Two Laws of Heyting Negation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"28211adc1b0ce5bc\" href=\"?note=28211adc1b0ce5bc\" title=\"14-df-category\">14-df-category</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d3923e299ec2ec5a\" href=\"?note=d3923e299ec2ec5a\" title=\"14-df-subobjects\">14-df-subobjects</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5aa17e379c0e3bc4\" href=\"?note=5aa17e379c0e3bc4\" title=\"14-thm-subobject-heyting-algebra\">14-thm-subobject-heyting-algebra</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"42b2e2d4b9f8fe9c\" href=\"?note=42b2e2d4b9f8fe9c\" title=\"14-df-heyting-negation\">14-df-heyting-negation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"4e6c05c92e3b9bf9\" href=\"?note=4e6c05c92e3b9bf9\" title=\"14-df-elementary-topos\">14-df-elementary-topos</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_status","html":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E\">\\(\\mathcal E\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"28211adc1b0ce5bc\" href=\"?note=28211adc1b0ce5bc\" title=\"14-df-category\">14-df-category</a> 的范畴；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IsElementaryTopos}\">\\(\\mathrm{IsElementaryTopos}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"4e6c05c92e3b9bf9\" href=\"?note=4e6c05c92e3b9bf9\" title=\"14-df-elementary-topos\">14-df-elementary-topos</a>。在其成立的分支，对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\">\\(X\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\\)</span>，采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"5aa17e379c0e3bc4\" href=\"?note=5aa17e379c0e3bc4\" title=\"14-thm-subobject-heyting-algebra\">14-thm-subobject-heyting-algebra</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb{Sub}_{\\mathcal E}(X)\">\\(\\mathbb{Sub}_{\\mathcal E}(X)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\wedge,\\leq\">\\(\\wedge,\\leq\\)</span> 分别缩写该结构的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\wedge_X,\\leq_X\">\\(\\wedge_X,\\leq_X\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Neg}_X\">\\(\\mathrm{Neg}_X\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"42b2e2d4b9f8fe9c\" href=\"?note=42b2e2d4b9f8fe9c\" title=\"14-df-heyting-negation\">14-df-heyting-negation</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IsElementaryTopos}(\\mathcal E)\\to\\forall X\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\\;\\forall A\\in\\mathrm{Sub}_{\\mathcal E}(X)\\;\\bigl(A\\wedge\\mathrm{Neg}_X(A)=\\bot_X\\land A\\leq\\mathrm{Neg}_X(\\mathrm{Neg}_X(A))\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{IsElementaryTopos}(\\mathcal E)\\to\\forall X\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\\;\\forall A\\in\\mathrm{Sub}_{\\mathcal E}(X)\\;\\bigl(A\\wedge\\mathrm{Neg}_X(A)=\\bot_X\\land A\\leq\\mathrm{Neg}_X(\\mathrm{Neg}_X(A))\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书定位：I.8，公式 (8)–(10) 与 Proposition 1，印刷页 52–53；DjVu 第 32 图页。对子对象应用 IV.8 Theorem 1 (External)，印刷页 201；DjVu 第 106 图页。</p>\n<p>由伴随律 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\leq A\\Rightarrow\\bot\\iff C\\wedge A\\leq\\bot\">\\(C\\leq A\\Rightarrow\\bot\\iff C\\wedge A\\leq\\bot\\)</span>，取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C=\\neg A\">\\(C=\\neg A\\)</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\wedge\\neg A=\\bot\">\\(A\\wedge\\neg A=\\bot\\)</span>；再把这个等式用于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\leq(\\neg A\\Rightarrow\\bot)\">\\(A\\leq(\\neg A\\Rightarrow\\bot)\\)</span> 得双重否定引入。两条等式只是直觉主义逻辑的片段，不冒称完整语法可靠性定理。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-category","status":"resolved","id":"28211adc1b0ce5bc","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-subobjects","status":"resolved","id":"d3923e299ec2ec5a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-subobjects]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-thm-subobject-heyting-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"5aa17e379c0e3bc4","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-thm-subobject-heyting-algebra]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-heyting-negation","status":"resolved","id":"42b2e2d4b9f8fe9c","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-heyting-negation]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-elementary-topos","status":"resolved","id":"4e6c05c92e3b9bf9","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on",